WEBVTT

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:36.494
The aim could not be more true.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:42.918
If the tree line is the wall
and we are two arrow flights scarce,

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.503
true aim does not matter, does it?

00:00:46.589 --> 00:00:48.298
We need to bring the engine closer.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:51.343
Bring it closer,
we will become pin cushions.

00:00:54.262 --> 00:00:55.556
We need a longer arm.

00:00:55.639 --> 00:00:57.808
Longer arm is bigger frame.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.686
Bigger frame is giant wheel.
Bigger rocks.

00:01:01.604 --> 00:01:04.022
You are making me to build a monster.

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:06.692
You were the finest
engine builder in Damascus, no?

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:07.818
Yes.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.527
Then build me a monster.

00:01:25.293 --> 00:01:27.545
[theme music playing]

00:03:15.988 --> 00:03:18.824
The Cricket Minister
comes this way.

00:03:19.783 --> 00:03:21.326
His troops are mobilizing.

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:25.205
War is upon us once again.

00:03:26.373 --> 00:03:29.501
Speak your decree, cousin.
It will be done.

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:40.012
There's no need for decrees.

00:03:41.471 --> 00:03:43.181
Or sermons to rouse.

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:46.143
We march...

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:48.270
before they do.

00:03:49.312 --> 00:03:50.981
Go.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.941
[Kaidu] By your will, Sire.

00:03:53.025 --> 00:03:56.904
And by the House of Ögödei,
I will lead your <i>tumens.</i>

00:03:56.987 --> 00:03:58.446
Praises, cousin.

00:03:59.697 --> 00:04:02.409
You will ride with
our <i>tumens</i> and my sons.

00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:06.496
I name you commander
of 1,000 men.

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:09.082
But I lead this assault.

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:12.252
You ride with the House of Kublai.

00:04:16.131 --> 00:04:18.967
I am grateful for the honor, Khagan.

00:04:22.387 --> 00:04:24.056
But hear me, please, cousin.

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:28.977
Twice my men and horses
have ridden under your banner.

00:04:29.061 --> 00:04:30.520
Twice my men...

00:04:31.897 --> 00:04:35.233
and two sons
have fallen to the Chinese.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.863
If I do not lead this next assault...

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:43.616
my men will return north,
and I with them.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.912
Lord Kaidu, there's no need to rush.

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:49.081
Let him rush.

00:04:49.164 --> 00:04:53.085
Let him rush home
to be king of his <i>ger</i> village.

00:04:54.086 --> 00:04:57.089
King of nomads and sheep.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.674
You mock nomads?

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:03.761
You mock Genghis?

00:05:03.846 --> 00:05:06.849
I mock cowards, no one else.

00:05:09.517 --> 00:05:12.729
Confer with your astrologers, cousin.

00:05:12.813 --> 00:05:16.316
Confer with your Chinese monks,
your Taoist priests.

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:19.694
Look to your Muslim imams
and all your prophets.

00:05:19.777 --> 00:05:23.490
How goes the Latin's
construction project?

00:05:23.573 --> 00:05:25.075
My understanding
from our engineers--

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:26.618
My engineers!

00:05:28.578 --> 00:05:32.790
[Kaidu] My understanding from
your engineers is that it is a gamble.

00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:35.335
-A fool's gamble!
-Mind your treason!

00:05:35.418 --> 00:05:36.669
Know this!

00:05:44.511 --> 00:05:49.557
As you lead your sons
back into the jaws of Sidao's China...

00:05:51.226 --> 00:05:56.189
I will march north to Karakorum
to defend the true Mongol capital.

00:05:56.273 --> 00:05:58.650
No one asked you to make a decree,

00:05:59.609 --> 00:06:04.281
yet you do so here
before the throne of the Khan of Khans?

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:07.242
I do not need your horses, Kaidu!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.746
I do not need your House of Ögödei!

00:06:19.254 --> 00:06:21.089
Leave here.

00:06:21.173 --> 00:06:23.425
You are forever banished.

00:06:55.582 --> 00:06:56.791
Come with me.

00:06:56.874 --> 00:07:00.420
When I have avenged my father,
I will come and honor yours.

00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:03.173
Look for me, Khutulun.

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:05.925
I will ride back
with many captured horses.

00:07:12.724 --> 00:07:15.102
Don't ride back with captured horses.

00:07:16.103 --> 00:07:17.895
Just ride back.

00:07:32.869 --> 00:07:33.996
[Jia Sidao] Rise.

00:07:40.252 --> 00:07:44.797
Great Emperor, Triumphant Chancellor.

00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:48.385
The men of Suzhou are saddened
by the passing of the Empress.

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:53.181
In honor of her memory,
I pledge 5,000 men to the Song army.

00:07:54.516 --> 00:07:58.603
The Governor of Suzhou.
Very important man.

00:07:58.686 --> 00:08:01.398
Richer in swordsmen
than he is in porcelain.

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:05.943
And he has presented us
with much porcelain in recent years.

00:08:06.028 --> 00:08:08.821
Will 5,000 troops suffice?

00:08:10.407 --> 00:08:11.408
[Zhao Xian] No!

00:08:12.575 --> 00:08:15.537
I will pledge 10,000 men,
my Sovereign.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.872
Ten thousand to
the great Song dynasty.

00:08:19.249 --> 00:08:21.459
[Jia Sidao] His Benevolence
is most pleased, Governor.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.837
We thank you and pledge
expansion of your domain

00:08:24.921 --> 00:08:27.549
when the Mongol plague is removed.

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:39.477
Pillow low, quilt is warm,

00:08:39.561 --> 00:08:42.647
body smooth and peaceful.

00:08:43.815 --> 00:08:46.609
Sun shines on the door,

00:08:46.693 --> 00:08:49.946
curtain not yet open.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:54.076
[Judar] Before bonds and agreements
can be duly made,

00:08:54.159 --> 00:08:56.869
a test of virtue must be witnessed.

00:08:58.371 --> 00:09:00.832
If these royal matrons

00:09:00.915 --> 00:09:04.877
witness no blood
upon entry of the pigeon's egg,

00:09:04.961 --> 00:09:08.881
it is deemed that the prospective bride
has been defiled.

00:09:10.967 --> 00:09:14.804
Pillow low, quilt is warm,

00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:18.683
body smooth and peaceful.

00:09:18.766 --> 00:09:22.979
The water flows,
mind of its own.

00:09:23.063 --> 00:09:26.149
The birds return to perch.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:39.954
[voice shaking] And when the test
has been made, if the chosen has--

00:09:40.037 --> 00:09:41.081
Enough, Judar.

00:10:00.308 --> 00:10:01.643
[gasps]

00:10:15.365 --> 00:10:18.951
Thus... when the blood
is of proper nature,

00:10:19.035 --> 00:10:22.539
the bride is proclaimed a virgin,

00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:25.542
the pending marriage valid.

00:10:26.501 --> 00:10:27.752
So be it.

00:10:29.379 --> 00:10:33.550
Sorrow and happiness
are the heresies of virtue, child.

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:37.470
As royalty,
you understand such formality.

00:10:58.825 --> 00:11:00.076
[man speaking native language]

00:11:09.377 --> 00:11:11.254
[Ahmad] Meditation?

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.508
I can sit for a count of 10

00:11:15.592 --> 00:11:18.970
before I start thinking of
all the things yet undone.

00:11:20.555 --> 00:11:23.850
How do Mongols
raise their girl children?

00:11:26.269 --> 00:11:29.272
You will never find
a more civilized queen,

00:11:29.356 --> 00:11:31.399
nor a more compassionate mother.

00:11:33.192 --> 00:11:35.695
But she is still a Mongol.

00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:40.242
And when it comes to
protecting her Khan and empire,

00:11:40.325 --> 00:11:42.452
she will do what needs to be done.

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:44.246
As will I...

00:11:45.622 --> 00:11:48.416
for kindness shown to my child.

00:11:53.463 --> 00:11:55.715
It is said that a nobleman
once drowned himself

00:11:55.798 --> 00:11:57.800
after a night in your bedchamber,

00:11:57.884 --> 00:12:00.928
because there was
nothing left to live for.

00:12:02.514 --> 00:12:05.642
Tea house songs
have a way of growing into fables.

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:09.145
There will be new songs
sung about you, Mei Lin.

00:12:09.228 --> 00:12:11.105
I hope not.

00:12:12.482 --> 00:12:13.983
You now long for anonymity?

00:12:14.066 --> 00:12:15.777
[distant drums beating]

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:17.987
I think most do.

00:12:21.032 --> 00:12:22.784
The drums would disagree.

00:12:24.661 --> 00:12:29.291
Every set of beats
tells of the Khan's mandate.

00:12:29.374 --> 00:12:32.209
And what do they say this night?

00:12:33.503 --> 00:12:34.671
War.

00:12:44.806 --> 00:12:49.352
[Jia Sidao] "Those skilled in warfare move
the enemy, and are not moved by the enemy.

00:12:51.854 --> 00:12:54.816
Get the enemy to approach
by his own accord.

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:58.778
If he's at ease, exhaust him.

00:12:58.861 --> 00:13:02.865
Well fed, starve him.
Settled, move him."

00:13:04.367 --> 00:13:09.706
I never knew you gave much merit
to Sun Tzu's treatise on war.

00:13:09.789 --> 00:13:11.458
I don't.

00:13:11.541 --> 00:13:14.168
But the fat Mongol
is trying to become Chinese.

00:13:14.251 --> 00:13:15.587
Do not think for one moment

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:17.714
that he will not
be consulting Sun Tzu's manual.

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:21.175
So, if he expects us to attack,
why mobilize?

00:13:21.258 --> 00:13:24.679
To draw the Mongols out.
Kublai is sick with defeat.

00:13:24.762 --> 00:13:29.517
When he hears we are mobilizing,
he will return, weakened in numbers,

00:13:29.601 --> 00:13:31.394
and by pride.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.945
Will they work?

00:13:41.028 --> 00:13:42.697
Every day we find
the engines getting stronger--

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.616
Will they work?

00:13:45.575 --> 00:13:46.909
By your will, Sire.

00:13:48.119 --> 00:13:49.912
And I will be ready to stand with them.

00:13:49.996 --> 00:13:52.331
We march whether
they are ready or not.

00:13:53.916 --> 00:13:55.752
Vice Regent Yusuf gave his life

00:13:55.835 --> 00:13:58.004
to give you this opportunity.
Remember that.

00:14:00.423 --> 00:14:03.843
I will avenge my brothers
who fell at Xiangyang.

00:14:03.926 --> 00:14:04.927
And should I fail--

00:14:05.011 --> 00:14:09.557
Should you fail, I will leave you
as carrion on the battlefield.

00:14:22.236 --> 00:14:23.988
[dog whimpering]

00:15:05.863 --> 00:15:09.659
I don't have much time
before Judar finds me missing.

00:15:09.742 --> 00:15:12.579
I need to know if you will follow me.

00:15:12.662 --> 00:15:14.163
Follow you?

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:19.043
I am to be Prince Jingim's wife.

00:15:21.378 --> 00:15:23.965
We must run. Now.

00:15:29.679 --> 00:15:31.681
I cannot.

00:15:31.764 --> 00:15:35.059
Is leaving here with me not your wish?

00:15:48.448 --> 00:15:50.658
We run, as you say.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:57.790
We make it past the guards,
the gate, the mountains...

00:15:58.875 --> 00:16:01.878
and praise our good fortune
every day we awaken.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:08.885
Because there will not be a single night
in which we are fully certain

00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:12.263
that a Mongol blade
will not find us in our sleep.

00:16:13.515 --> 00:16:18.352
There is nothing beyond those walls
but doubt and fear.

00:16:18.435 --> 00:16:23.149
All we can change is here...
in this place.

00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:26.235
And how do you propose to do that?

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:29.321
I must win this war for the Khan.

00:16:29.405 --> 00:16:32.324
And you think he will give me to you?

00:16:33.325 --> 00:16:34.911
Just like that?

00:16:36.829 --> 00:16:38.414
It's the only way.

00:17:09.028 --> 00:17:11.030
[footsteps approaching]

00:17:27.213 --> 00:17:31.175
Do you desire a sip?
I believe you need one.

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.597
I just need your good words.

00:17:41.435 --> 00:17:46.691
In one of my darkest hours,
cold and lost in the Wudang Mountains,

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:52.572
my life was saved
by a small yellow bird.

00:17:54.782 --> 00:17:55.950
How?

00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:58.452
I caught it and ate it.

00:17:58.535 --> 00:18:02.707
That is a terrible story, Sifu,
in which I find no wisdom.

00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:07.837
Your destiny is sealed
by those machines.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.131
When you march south,

00:18:10.214 --> 00:18:12.800
if you take the wall,
you will be lauded.

00:18:12.884 --> 00:18:14.761
Should you fail,

00:18:15.552 --> 00:18:19.473
there is no other soul
to sacrifice in your place.

00:18:19.556 --> 00:18:21.558
[Jingim]
There will be no such march, Sifu.

00:18:23.269 --> 00:18:25.146
Not for the Latin.

00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:28.065
And when I return from Xiangyang,

00:18:28.149 --> 00:18:30.902
he will be well on his way home
to his thief father.

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:37.574
Defeat me now
and you can fight in this war.

00:18:37.659 --> 00:18:42.163
Lose... and you will ride
for Venice at first light.

00:20:00.657 --> 00:20:01.868
[Hundred Eyes] Enough.

00:20:15.006 --> 00:20:17.299
Avoid me on the field.

00:20:28.185 --> 00:20:30.479
Do you now desire that sip?

00:20:51.667 --> 00:20:54.170
The Empress has
warned me about you.

00:20:54.253 --> 00:20:57.048
I am certain she has.

00:20:59.133 --> 00:21:02.678
Do you think I would grant you
an audience with the Blue Princess?

00:21:02.762 --> 00:21:06.432
No. I have learned that lesson well.

00:21:07.349 --> 00:21:08.475
Clearly not.

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:12.063
[Marco] I leave tonight with the army.

00:21:13.314 --> 00:21:14.731
But I will return.

00:21:18.527 --> 00:21:20.696
I do not ask to see her.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:24.116
All I ask is that you deliver
something to her from me.

00:21:26.911 --> 00:21:28.204
This...

00:21:29.371 --> 00:21:30.790
is from the Silk Road...

00:21:31.833 --> 00:21:34.626
a place I hope to show her one day.

00:21:44.386 --> 00:21:46.597
[Taoist priest] The <i>I Ching</i> says this:

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:51.268
"Attempt to seize all of China
and destruction will follow.

00:21:51.352 --> 00:21:53.312
The Silk Road you once opened

00:21:53.395 --> 00:21:56.899
will be overtaken by
a black cloud from the West,

00:21:56.983 --> 00:22:00.444
leaving nothing but weeds and nettles."

00:22:00.527 --> 00:22:02.571
You speak any more poetry, Priest,

00:22:02.654 --> 00:22:05.449
you'll be growing weeds and nettles
out of your dung hole.

00:22:05.532 --> 00:22:07.451
Mind your nature, husband.

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:14.291
Your Most Benevolent and Holy Khan,
the <i>I Ching</i> tells no lies.

00:22:14.375 --> 00:22:15.877
Return war to the South

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:18.587
and there may never be harmony

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:22.633
between the heavenly and primal.

00:22:40.192 --> 00:22:42.444
You observe that?

00:22:42.528 --> 00:22:44.863
He looked at you
when he said "the heavenly."

00:22:44.947 --> 00:22:48.117
Why conscript these priests
and prophets into service

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:49.410
if you do not heed their words?

00:22:49.493 --> 00:22:51.787
That priest is from South China.

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:53.830
How do we know
he does not have grandchildren

00:22:53.915 --> 00:22:55.624
behind those walls down there?

00:22:55.707 --> 00:22:57.459
Hear me, Kublai.

00:22:57.543 --> 00:23:00.462
You have only half the men and horses
you had on the last march.

00:23:00.546 --> 00:23:01.713
Kaidu has gone north.

00:23:01.797 --> 00:23:03.174
Banished north.

00:23:03.257 --> 00:23:06.302
Your men are tired, uncertain.

00:23:07.428 --> 00:23:10.056
Another defeat will destroy the empire.

00:23:11.307 --> 00:23:14.768
Proclaiming peace will not only
preserve men, it will preserve face.

00:23:14.851 --> 00:23:16.687
I care not about preserving face.

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:21.233
Preserving life, then.
My husband's life, my son's life.

00:23:21.317 --> 00:23:25.904
My war is with South China,
not with my wife and Empress.

00:23:25.988 --> 00:23:29.700
You know I heed your wisdom,
but there's no more waiting!

00:23:29.783 --> 00:23:34.330
This wall must break before me
or I die trying!

00:23:34.413 --> 00:23:36.207
There's nothing else!

00:24:11.993 --> 00:24:13.202
[beads clattering]

00:24:24.005 --> 00:24:25.756
[drums beating]

00:24:28.259 --> 00:24:29.343
Hyah!

00:24:37.684 --> 00:24:39.395
[crickets chirping]

00:24:54.451 --> 00:24:56.037
[chirping stops]

00:25:11.009 --> 00:25:13.095
[men speaking Mandarin]

00:25:27.109 --> 00:25:28.694
[throat singing]

00:25:45.502 --> 00:25:46.628
Have you lit a fire?

00:25:46.712 --> 00:25:49.631
-I have.
-Light four more.

00:25:49.715 --> 00:25:53.094
Each of us ignites five fires,
every one man becomes many.

00:25:54.595 --> 00:25:57.055
An art of my great-grandfather's.

00:25:57.139 --> 00:25:59.683
War against the enemy's mind.

00:26:02.018 --> 00:26:06.107
I fear my father is desperate to believe
in your European war machines.

00:26:06.190 --> 00:26:07.524
As am I.

00:26:08.567 --> 00:26:11.027
-Will they work?
-They must.

00:26:11.987 --> 00:26:14.490
Is that how life works?

00:26:20.246 --> 00:26:22.706
Kaidu did not ride with the Khan.

00:26:25.167 --> 00:26:28.712
If we lose tomorrow,
he will become Khan.

00:26:28.795 --> 00:26:29.838
Of what?

00:26:29.921 --> 00:26:34.135
There will be nothing left to rule
when Chinese loyalty returns to Jia Sidao.

00:26:35.677 --> 00:26:39.181
In truth, I fear what may happen
should we win.

00:27:00.994 --> 00:27:02.538
[singing stops]

00:27:04.873 --> 00:27:07.168
Please, sit.

00:27:18.220 --> 00:27:19.846
[singing resumes]

00:27:40.033 --> 00:27:45.206
What you did... defending me
in front of your father and brother...

00:27:46.748 --> 00:27:48.584
I can never repay you.

00:27:48.667 --> 00:27:50.336
I simply spoke the truth.

00:27:50.419 --> 00:27:54.047
The man you must truly repay
can never collect his debt.

00:27:56.925 --> 00:27:58.802
I must light my fires.

00:28:03.682 --> 00:28:05.642
Set my trebuchets.

00:28:05.726 --> 00:28:09.062
And test the Song wall.

00:29:08.289 --> 00:29:11.875
[Jia Sidao] Catapults.
Tried and failed.

00:29:12.501 --> 00:29:14.628
[Red Brow] No, it's something else.

00:29:14.711 --> 00:29:17.423
-Are the men prepared?
-They are.

00:29:19.174 --> 00:29:21.051
[Jia Sidao] Then let the war begin.

00:29:26.014 --> 00:29:27.683
[man shouting commands in Mandarin]

00:30:12.143 --> 00:30:14.062
Do you wish to give the order, Sire?

00:30:39.380 --> 00:30:40.756
Fire!

00:30:50.807 --> 00:30:52.518
[horse whinnying]

00:31:00.484 --> 00:31:01.943
More counterweight, Talib.

00:31:02.027 --> 00:31:04.195
-Any more weight, the axle will--
-More counterweight!

00:31:05.030 --> 00:31:07.240
[Talib shouting orders]

00:31:21.463 --> 00:31:22.464
[Talib] Enough!

00:32:08.301 --> 00:32:10.596
-Again!
-Again!

00:32:12.848 --> 00:32:14.265
[men screaming]

00:32:37.706 --> 00:32:40.125
[Jia Sidao] Take him to the tunnels.
Wait for me there.

00:32:45.338 --> 00:32:47.007
Teacher, I'm scared.

00:32:49.676 --> 00:32:52.095
Do not fear the wolves of the steppe.

00:32:52.178 --> 00:32:55.974
They are but wind
howling in the night, rattling doors.

00:32:56.057 --> 00:32:58.309
An emperor does not fear the thunder.

00:32:58.393 --> 00:33:00.103
All you need is this.

00:33:01.437 --> 00:33:04.190
I will come for you very soon.

00:33:23.627 --> 00:33:24.920
[Kublai grunting]

00:33:39.017 --> 00:33:40.310
Speak, boy.

00:33:40.393 --> 00:33:44.147
It is going to be a long night.
A long day will follow.

00:33:44.230 --> 00:33:46.817
But it will be well worth it in the end.

00:33:49.152 --> 00:33:51.029
It doesn't feel as it should.

00:33:51.947 --> 00:33:53.114
Sire?

00:33:53.198 --> 00:33:55.534
I should feel more joy.

00:33:55.617 --> 00:33:59.996
When you are triumphant,
happiness will come.

00:34:00.789 --> 00:34:02.373
You're certain?

00:34:02.457 --> 00:34:03.750
I am.

00:34:05.293 --> 00:34:08.797
You will take the wall
and open the gate to all China.

00:34:10.381 --> 00:34:12.718
The dreams of your fathers
will be realized.

00:34:14.720 --> 00:34:17.430
As will your own.

00:34:18.181 --> 00:34:20.767
I must return to the line.

00:34:25.897 --> 00:34:26.898
[Kublai winces]

00:34:42.330 --> 00:34:43.707
-Right, ready?
-[men respond in native language]

00:34:45.876 --> 00:34:46.918
Left, ready?

00:34:47.002 --> 00:34:48.879
[men respond in native language]

00:34:57.929 --> 00:34:58.930
Fire.

00:35:09.440 --> 00:35:10.942
[whooshing]

00:35:21.244 --> 00:35:22.829
[soldiers cheering]

00:35:27.626 --> 00:35:30.545
They've broken through, Chancellor.

00:35:34.675 --> 00:35:38.929
All walls are built by men's hands
and they crumble by them as well.

00:35:40.931 --> 00:35:44.851
I will commend the Khan
just prior to taking his head.

00:35:46.394 --> 00:35:49.230
-Where is the breach?
-East of the gate tower.

00:35:52.233 --> 00:35:56.446
They will charge in their
Mongol formations by units of 10.

00:35:56.529 --> 00:36:00.033
Six of every 10 will be light archers.

00:36:00.116 --> 00:36:02.703
The remaining four
will be heavy lancers.

00:36:03.704 --> 00:36:05.706
Are the fire lancers ready?

00:36:05.789 --> 00:36:08.667
At your word, I give the command.

00:36:14.464 --> 00:36:16.717
All horses to the breach.

00:36:16.800 --> 00:36:17.843
[responds in native language]

00:36:17.926 --> 00:36:19.219
[shouts command]

00:36:46.872 --> 00:36:47.873
Hyah!

00:36:56.923 --> 00:36:58.341
[all shouting]

00:36:58.424 --> 00:36:59.801
[man shouting commands in Mandarin]

00:37:05.223 --> 00:37:07.142
[shouting commands]

00:37:08.684 --> 00:37:10.353
[shouting commands]

00:37:57.692 --> 00:37:59.778
[shouting in distance]

00:38:13.541 --> 00:38:14.667
Now.

00:38:26.387 --> 00:38:28.681
[men shouting]

00:38:36.898 --> 00:38:38.191
[man shouting commands in Mandarin]

00:38:43.071 --> 00:38:45.115
[men grunting]

00:38:48.576 --> 00:38:50.620
[shouting]

00:38:50.703 --> 00:38:52.205
-[gunshots]
-[men grunting]

00:38:56.376 --> 00:39:00.130
[shouting]

00:39:11.892 --> 00:39:13.476
[screaming]

00:39:38.793 --> 00:39:41.712
Black powder!
Sidao has black powder!

00:39:42.713 --> 00:39:45.550
They've blocked the breach
with spears of fire.

00:39:45.633 --> 00:39:47.218
They're slaughtering our men!

00:39:47.302 --> 00:39:48.469
Push through.

00:39:50.013 --> 00:39:53.099
Prince Jingim has fallen, Great Khan.

00:40:09.615 --> 00:40:10.700
[yells]

00:40:15.163 --> 00:40:17.332
[gunshots in distance]

00:40:45.485 --> 00:40:46.611
[groans]

00:40:56.537 --> 00:40:57.663
[panting]

00:40:59.457 --> 00:41:00.959
Surround the Prince!

00:41:14.014 --> 00:41:15.640
[gunshots]

00:41:32.490 --> 00:41:34.450
-[man shouts command in Mandarin]
-[soldiers respond]

00:41:34.534 --> 00:41:35.701
[shouting]

00:42:26.919 --> 00:42:28.921
[men shouting]

00:43:13.799 --> 00:43:16.302
[Jia Sidao] A round-eye?

00:43:17.928 --> 00:43:21.557
What stake do you have in this fight?

00:43:26.187 --> 00:43:29.482
Come down and surrender to your Khan.

00:43:33.819 --> 00:43:35.905
Surrender the Song dynasty...

00:43:37.532 --> 00:43:38.908
to a Mongol...

00:43:42.328 --> 00:43:46.207
by order of a European.

00:43:49.084 --> 00:43:50.295
[grunts]

00:44:00.180 --> 00:44:01.181
Hmm.

00:44:02.682 --> 00:44:03.766
[bone breaking]

00:44:10.815 --> 00:44:11.982
[bone breaking]

00:44:16.237 --> 00:44:17.613
[Marco whimpering]

00:44:19.907 --> 00:44:23.203
You white devils...
on the Silk Road...

00:44:24.162 --> 00:44:27.540
grovel for the Khan's favor.

00:44:27.623 --> 00:44:29.209
You have much to learn.

00:44:29.292 --> 00:44:31.377
[Hundred Eyes] Chancellor.

00:44:31.461 --> 00:44:35.631
Even a blind man can see that it is over.

00:45:00.781 --> 00:45:01.907
[bone breaking]

00:45:18.966 --> 00:45:20.926
[bones cracking]

00:45:21.010 --> 00:45:22.094
[grunts]

00:45:56.337 --> 00:45:57.838
[bones cracking]

00:46:08.182 --> 00:46:10.976
[grunting]

00:46:28.703 --> 00:46:32.790
[whispering] May Song dynasty
endure 10,000 more years.

00:46:50.475 --> 00:46:51.476
[bones cracking]

00:47:29.304 --> 00:47:31.265
Where's the boy?

00:47:34.394 --> 00:47:36.103
-Find him.
-[soldiers respond]

00:48:26.654 --> 00:48:29.907
[soldiers chanting]

00:49:07.862 --> 00:49:12.492
Auspicious that I didn't defeat you
with my sword back in Cambulac.

00:49:12.575 --> 00:49:14.159
Prince.

00:49:18.038 --> 00:49:21.000
Our Khan will want to
hear your account, Polo.

00:49:22.459 --> 00:49:26.672
Then he will hear that his son fought
like his great-grandfather, Genghis.

00:49:27.381 --> 00:49:29.133
A Khan worthy of the throne.

00:49:32.970 --> 00:49:34.179
[grunts]

00:49:41.061 --> 00:49:42.938
Peace to you...

00:49:43.022 --> 00:49:44.398
brother.

00:51:03.227 --> 00:51:07.272
[men shouting]

00:51:21.411 --> 00:51:23.080
Kokachin.

00:51:51.108 --> 00:51:52.317
[man speaking native language]

00:52:03.245 --> 00:52:04.496
[grunts]

00:53:22.950 --> 00:53:24.618
-Do you like it?
-[gasps]

00:53:28.372 --> 00:53:31.959
Liu Guandao,
esteemed Song dynasty painter.

00:53:33.460 --> 00:53:36.922
If you do not like it,
you do not have to say so.

00:53:38.715 --> 00:53:41.010
I find it...

00:53:43.971 --> 00:53:45.848
exquisite.